Video Transcript: AI Saved Search Assistant
[Scene 1: Introduction]
Visual: Start with a quick screen recording or screenshot of the full "AI Saved Search Assistant" dashboard.
Audio: "Hello! Today, I want to show you a brand new tool we built to make finding data in NetSuite easier than ever. Meet the AI Saved Search Assistant. It’s a smart chatbot that builds NetSuite saved searches for you, completely automatically, just by chatting with it."

[Scene 2: Explaining the UI]
Visual: Zoom in on the left side of the screen (the Quota badge), then pan over to the right side (the Chat interface).
Audio: "First, let's look at the interface. It's designed to be incredibly simple.

